VioletCity_TrainerSchool_Text_Earl:
	.string "EARL I am! Good at teaching!\n"
	.string "Come to my school and learn\lall about POKeMON!$"

VioletCity_TrainerSchool_Text_Girl:
	.string "I heard some POKeMON only evolve\n"
	.string "when they really trust you!$"

VioletCity_TrainerSchool_Text_Kid:
	.string "I'm going to get my first\n"
	.string "POKeMON soon! I can't wait!$"

VioletCity_School_Text_Blackboard:
	.string "Type Matchup Chart\n"
	.string "Water > Fire > Grass > Water\p"
	.string "Flying > Bug > Grass\n"
	.string "Electric > Water > Ground$"

VioletCity_School_Text_Boy1:
	.string "EARL teaches us about type\n"
	.string "advantages.\p"
	.string "Water beats Fire, Fire beats\n"
	.string "Grass... It's a lot to\l"
	.string "remember!$"

VioletCity_School_Text_Boy2:
	.string "I want to be a GYM LEADER\n"
	.string "when I grow up!\p"
	.string "FALKNER is so cool!$"

VioletCity_School_Text_Teacher:
	.string "I assist EARL with his\n"
	.string "classes.\p"
	.string "Teaching the next generation\n"
	.string "of TRAINERS is rewarding!$"

VioletCity_School_Text_Twin:
	.string "My twin and I are both\n"
	.string "studying to be TRAINERS!\p"
	.string "We're going to travel JOHTO\n"
	.string "together someday!$"

